stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ACCOUNT_UNRESOLVED
    ACCOUNT_UNRESOLVED --> ACCOUNT_AVAILABLE: sign in/create account
    ACCOUNT_UNRESOLVED --> ACCOUNT_DEGRADED: offline cached context

    state ACCOUNT_AVAILABLE {
        [*] --> ENTITLEMENT_UNKNOWN
        ENTITLEMENT_UNKNOWN --> FREE: free entitlement
        ENTITLEMENT_UNKNOWN --> PRO: pro entitlement
        ENTITLEMENT_UNKNOWN --> OFFLINE_VALID: cached entitlement accepted
        ENTITLEMENT_UNKNOWN --> UNAVAILABLE: entitlement unavailable/expired
    }

    FREE --> BASE_WINDOWS: managed runtime disabled
    PRO --> MODE_SELECTION: managed runtime enabled
    OFFLINE_VALID --> MODE_SELECTION: policy permits managed runtime
    OFFLINE_VALID --> BASE_WINDOWS: policy limits premium runtime
    UNAVAILABLE --> BASE_WINDOWS: safe fallback

    MODE_SELECTION --> WORK: Work committed
    MODE_SELECTION --> GAME: Game committed
    WORK --> GAME: successful Work→Game
    GAME --> WORK: successful Game→Work

    PRO --> FREE: downgrade/expiry after safe deactivation
    BASE_WINDOWS --> MODE_SELECTION: upgrade enables managed runtime
